Red Agency Ads is live at [redagencyads.vercel.app](https://redagencyads.vercel.app/landing). The current product has account registration, shared workspaces, member invitations, saved reports, bilingual output, and a smart assistant that reads the active workspace context without sending tokens, uploaded files, or raw provider payloads. I am still developing it, but it is no longer the three-screen Meta dashboard shown in the old case study.
